WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:21.580
Ma cherie La Poupee...

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.090
Ma cherie La Poupee...

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.180
Saint-Juste-sama...!

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:48.780
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.700
She looks like you!

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:01.670
Look! She looks just like you...

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:04.480
Ma cherie La Poupee.

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.640
My dear, cute little Poupee.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.230
Saint-Juste-sama...!

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:25.730
<b>12. The Scar</b>

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:03.890
Along a ridge in the rolling hills...

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:06.960
...there is a cobblestone road.

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.230
A little horse-drawn carriage traverses the path.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:17.080
Ko ton, ko ton, kotokoton...

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:22.870
...I hear it bumping over the cobblestoned road.

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:25.280
Ah...

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.060
...finally it passes over the third hill...

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:33.720
Ko ton, ko ton, kotokotokoton...

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:38.940
I think I've always known my final destination...

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:42.020
...there, the top of the fifth hill.

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.510
I can see you there... at the top.

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:03.500
So... aren't you hungry yet?

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:06.400
I can make apple juice! It's good for you...

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.310
...and it's quick and easy... if you want...

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:13.650
If you have eggs and milk, I can make custard pudding...!

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:17.970
If there's cornstarch, I can make <i>manju</i> too -- mine's really good!

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:24.400
I'll fix something. Please give me a few minutes.

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:30.970
Oh -- also, I called Kaoru-no-Kimi.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.550
Kaoru?

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:35.080
She should be right over!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.080
This won't turn on...

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:54.720
My Dear Brother...

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:58.930
There was no fruit, and not even milk or butter...

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:02.960
...just a little bit of old frozen food...

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.290
Totally alone...

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.380
All the windows closed,

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:14.710
...in this room filled with mirrors...

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:22.160
Returning each day from school to this dark, ice-cold room alone...

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:28.670
...with nothing here to eat... How on earth can she live?

00:06:30.030 --> 00:06:33.520
My dear brother, I... I...

00:06:57.450 --> 00:07:00.000
I'm sorry I called you like this...

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:02.690
...but I didn't know what to do.

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:04.090
How's her fever?

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.750
Still very high.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.580
<i>Qu'est-ce que vous faites ici, mademoiselle?</i> What are you doing here, Miss?

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.590
A pretty high fever...

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.600
I like it that way...

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.850
Are you a masochist?!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.870
Look at this! Look at this!

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.680
You're STILL wearing it!!

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.970
Give it back to me! Give it back!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:55.600
Why?? Why must you wear this?!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.950
Give it back to me!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.770
This thing is a curse you've placed on yourself!

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.130
Give it ba...

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.070
This is the curse of Miya-sama!

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:10.050
As long as you wear this, you'll stay trapped under her curse!

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.550
I'm going to throw it into the bottom of the canal!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:19.760
Damned thing...!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.540
Nothing will change!

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:14.850
Nothing will change while you wear that!

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:18.370
You know that, so why won't you take it off!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.370
Rei!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.870
Kotokoton...

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:25.340
What?

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:29.230
Ko ton, ko ton, kotokotokoton...

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:44.300
Please, take care of Saint-Juste...?

00:09:44.300 --> 00:09:45.170
OK.

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.750
Please, forget what you saw today.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:55.610
Please pretend it was all a dream.

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:19.010
The scar.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:21.850
That scar, hidden under the bracelet...

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:26.720
...I tried to avoid imagining what could have caused it.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:32.890
But it kept coming back to me, that hidden scar!

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:35.840
I couldn't help but think... Suicide?

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.870
I don't know her past...

00:10:41.920 --> 00:10:46.000
But, knowing her now, it could be possible.

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:52.440
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.480
Can you go to the elm tree?

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:04.600
Maybe... she is there...

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.830
Why are you still talking like that!

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:10.820
You had to wait in the rain, and caught this fever!

00:11:11.050 --> 00:11:12.390
Why are you so obsessed?

00:11:12.670 --> 00:11:19.440
I can tolerate such a thing, myself, easily...

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:24.510
But it's different if it is HER getting wet in the rain...

00:11:25.270 --> 00:11:26.340
I could not tolerate such a thing.

00:11:28.350 --> 00:11:30.760
Please go to the elm tree.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.110
Enough!

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.930
I'm going to lose my temper with you!!

00:11:40.540 --> 00:11:44.290
I'm... I'm sorry. Please forgive me.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.040
You can be so difficult!

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:48.250
Leaving the cram-session right in the middle...

00:11:48.410 --> 00:11:49.880
I was worrying about you!

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:53.380
Yes. Everyone's already gone home.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:57.880
May I come by to pick up my bag?

00:11:58.240 --> 00:12:00.780
I gave your bag to Shinobu-san.

00:12:01.250 --> 00:12:03.260
You can get it from her tomorrow.

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:07.490
Oh, then... the umbrella you loaned me...

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.970
Tomorrow's OK....

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:13.120
I'm truly sorry...

00:12:15.260 --> 00:12:17.000
Well, I'll say goodbye... <b> </b>

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:17.940
Well, I'll say goodbye... What happened?

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.440
Something must have happened to you...

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:23.980
...when you went to school to get your notebook?

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:28.400
Oh! No... nothing really! Not at school...

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:31.720
The rain -- it was the rain!

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:35.800
So I got wet... and felt a bit ill... so...

00:12:36.010 --> 00:12:38.290
So... I rested at a friend's house...

00:12:39.090 --> 00:12:41.910
Tomoko! Arikura Tomoko, she's in Section A...

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:43.180
I understand.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:47.170
If you felt ill, then that was the only thing to do.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.380
Yes. I'm sorry!

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:52.840
Good-night.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.120
This is the curse of Miya-sama!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.280
As long as you wear this, you'll stay trapped under her curse!

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:54.970
All right, now!

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:56.750
Well!

00:13:57.510 --> 00:13:59.120
I'm surprised!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:01.530
Isn't it early for you to be up already?

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:03.310
Yes, I suppose...

00:14:03.470 --> 00:14:06.150
We're having a cram session at the Sorority House this morning!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:08.380
Well! A sandwich...?

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:12.320
Sure. We'll have breakfast after the study session.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.800
You never liked tomatoes before...

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:16.350
I've come to like them...

00:14:16.350 --> 00:14:18.560
I need my vitamin A.

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:20.570
What's all this now...?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.400
It's her "vitamin A".

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:24.630
Now now, don't get in the way...

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.730
Your sandwiches...

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:43.230
I seem to recall you making one for MY lunch once...

00:14:43.640 --> 00:14:47.790
Yes... I think your mother had a cold that day.

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.610
It was really tasty!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:51.840
Next time, then.

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:54.950
Sure... Next time...

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.600
See you later!

00:15:00.310 --> 00:15:01.710
Vitamin A...?

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:03.630
What about it?

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.230
Well...

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.120
There is no cram session. I lied.

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.860
Sorry, Mom and Dad...

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:20.150
Strangely enough, my dear brother,

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.660
...this is something which seems to deeply touch my heart,

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:27.010
...and even if I have to lie or disobey someone, I must act.

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:37.840
Anyway, she MUST eat some nutritious food.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.500
She must be still sleeping.

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.190
"How are you?"

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:05.280
"I decided to bring you a box-lunch."

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:08.580
"Please eat a lot and sleep tight."

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:10.320
"Get healthy soon."

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.600
"Very soon, please, very soon."

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.000
"I brought you a sandwich, a salad, and coffee..."

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:21.170
"Please feel better soon."

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:33.550
That should do. If she eats it...

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:45.270
Nanako-san!

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:46.160
Yes? <b> </b>

00:16:46.160 --> 00:16:47.700
Yes? Here's your bag!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.630
Thank you...

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:51.990
It had started to rain furiously!

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:54.630
A lot of time had passed...

00:16:54.730 --> 00:17:00.760
...and you still weren't back when the session ended.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:05.540
When we called the school, the custodian said there was no one there.

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:08.040
The thought of an accident happening to you...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.190
...made us more and more worried!

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:13.540
Mona-Lisa-sama and Borgia-sama had left...

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:16.280
Miya-sama and I were the only ones left.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:20.480
Then I had to leave myself, shortly after ten.

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:23.700
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.620
I called her around 10:30 and apologized.

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.950
Maybe not quite enough, though...

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.540
Was your apology accepted?

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:33.110
Yes. I think.

00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:34.800
Oh good, I'm relieved.

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:38.050
Having Miya-sama upset at you can be VERY bad news.

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:38.590
So...?? <b> </b>

00:17:38.590 --> 00:17:39.390
So...?? What?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.670
So what was it? What happened?

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:43.340
Tell me, I won't tell.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.040
Oh! <b> </b>

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:44.440
Oh! Hmmm?

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:46.520
Later! I'll tell you later!

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.330
Uh... Nanako-san!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:51.970
Oh no! I've got to talk to Tomoko quickly!

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:54.420
Tomoko!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:55.690
What?

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:57.860
An alibi? <b> </b>

00:17:57.860 --> 00:17:59.200
An alibi? Yes... I'm sorry!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.420
I happened to use you as an alibi...

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:04.780
I told them that I was at your place...

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:08.000
So, if anyone asks, can you say that?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.480
Asked by whom?

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.310
Your father and mother?

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:15.060
Oh no! You're in trouble!

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:16.890
No, no! It's not like that!

00:18:17.050 --> 00:18:20.530
Well.. in short, it's for the sorority.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.000
Oh, so THAT's it!

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:24.040
Yes. <b> </b>

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:24.970
Yes. Sure, then.

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:26.720
Especially Miya-sama.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:28.730
I got it! Sure!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.680
Thanks! I'll explain later.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.230
That's OK. You just owe me one!

00:18:35.650 --> 00:18:36.460
Deal!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.490
My dear brother...

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.460
the first session came and went.

00:18:54.950 --> 00:18:56.690
Then the second.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:00.040
The third session began and got to lunch time...

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.090
I worried the whole time.

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:04.350
I finally made up my mind.

00:19:04.940 --> 00:19:07.820
I resolved then to return the umbrella.

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.490
Here it is. Thank you very much.

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.990
Keep it.

00:19:30.900 --> 00:19:34.190
If you don't like it, throw it away.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:45.890
Don't get too close to Asaka Rei-san

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:06.960
I didn't get close to her intentionally.

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:09.750
It just happened that I was there.

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.920
With her, in the rain.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:14.490
That's all.

00:20:28.650 --> 00:20:30.530
Ummm... excuse me...

00:20:31.060 --> 00:20:33.010
She seems to have taken the day off...

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.470
Was she OK?

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.830
Afterwards?

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:40.240
She was fine. She fell asleep.

00:20:40.770 --> 00:20:42.650
What about her fever?

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:45.390
I had her take some aspirin right away...

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:46.670
...but it wasn't too effective.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:49.820
She takes too many drugs already, you know.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:51.380
I see...

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:04.650
What is it?

00:21:05.930 --> 00:21:08.000
Could I meet you after school?

00:21:08.490 --> 00:21:09.630
To talk...

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.320
What is this regarding?

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:14.490
I'll be waiting for you.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:16.630
Under the elm tree!

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:17.950
The elm tree?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:21.160
Yes, under the elm tree...

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:36.190
Four forty eight and thirty seconds.

00:21:41.140 --> 00:21:46.100
Four forty eight and forty seconds.

00:21:51.220 --> 00:21:56.110
Four forty eight and fifty seconds.

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:05.920
Four forty nine and zero seconds.

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:24.340
It was no coincidence.

00:22:25.720 --> 00:22:28.530
I wanted Mariko-san and Tomoko to go home.

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:33.390
That way I could visit Saint-Juste-sama.

00:22:33.760 --> 00:22:35.500
I'm not sure why I wanted to...

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.620
...but I wanted to see that elm tree again.

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:48.710
...the one Saint-Juste stood under for so long in the rain...

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:54.980
Saint-Juste-sama?

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:05.420
What's this about?

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:09.420
You know already.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:11.170
Yes.

00:23:12.230 --> 00:23:16.250
This is the elm tree where Rei waited for you yesterday!

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:19.180
She got soaked and caught a fever!

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:24.030
Don't you care at all what happens to Rei ??!

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:27.110
It doesn't concern me.

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:29.080
But Rei...

00:23:29.620 --> 00:23:31.500
But Rei is your younger sister!

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...

00:25:01.630 --> 00:25:03.980
Preview.

00:25:03.980 --> 00:25:06.830
Feelings of doom, due to Miya-sama's curse,

00:25:06.830 --> 00:25:09.240
...fill Saint-Juste with hopeless depression and cynicism.

00:25:09.400 --> 00:25:10.950
Nanako, worried about Saint-Juste,

00:25:10.950 --> 00:25:13.560
...goes to the clock tower to look for her.

00:25:14.580 --> 00:25:16.390
Rei embraces Nanako...

00:25:16.390 --> 00:25:19.130
...and whispers something in her ear.

00:25:20.020 --> 00:25:21.090
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:21.100 --> 00:25:22.500
Next episode: <b>A Tale of Double Suicide</b>

00:25:22.820 --> 00:25:24.430
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:24.430 --> 00:25:27.920
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
